2️⃣ FRD – Functional Requirement Document
Functional Requirements

Service Performance Analysis

System should display revenue and transaction volume by service

Drill-down by service type (Loan, Insurance, Recharge, etc.)

Transaction Status Tracking

Show Successful, Failed, Pending transactions

Categorize failure reasons (Server Error, Wrong PIN, Insufficient Balance)

Trend Analysis

Monthly and quarterly transaction trends

Identify peak and low-performing months

Visualization Requirements

Bar, Line, Pie, and Donut charts

Filters for date, service, payment status

Insights Dashboard

Highlight key insights and recommendations

Exportable reports
